      "value": "@{5bbfe7082f9bdf3d5024c14d|full_name}: ABSOLUTELY NOT!\nThe point of Blocking someone is to cut them out completely, they should ideally have no idea you are in the same room as them.  Especially if it's due to harassment of some form, because if someone's, say, getting up in your personal space and they just turn shadowy instead of disappearing, they're just gonna keep doing it and it achieves nothing.",
