      "value": "@{5e89d0822aedbc56a3155d12|full_name}: if persnonal space is your issue the is a helpful setting for that litteraly called personal space, it stops anyone from being visable to you when the get to close that paired with a mute or this shadow block propsiton would mean they exist but not anywhere near you",
